, Gurmail and Rowland, Natalie and Atherton, Kristy and Brown, James and Clouston, Hamish and Coe, Pete and Duarte, Rui and Dudi-Venkata, Nagendra N. and Duff, Sarah and Egoroff, Natasha and Fish, Rebecca and Glasbey, James and Ives, Natalie and Kaur, Manjinder and Magill, Laura and Mehta, Samir and Pinkney, Thomas and Pockney, Peter and Richards, Toby and Sammour, Tarik and Sekhar, Hema and Sinha, Yash and Stott, Martyn and Wilkin, Richard},
